        "text": "**OpenAI Codex** is OpenAI's cloud-based **software engineering agent**. Launched in May 2025, it runs on the `codex-1` model (later versions use **GPT‑5‑Codex**, a GPT‑5 variant optimized for agentic coding). Rather than just autocompleting code, Codex works like a teammate: it can handle multiple tasks **in parallel** in a sandboxed cloud environment — building projects from scratch, adding features and tests, debugging, performing large-scale refactors, and doing code reviews.\n\nIt's accessible through ChatGPT plans (Pro, Business, Enterprise, and Plus), as well as via a CLI and IDE extension. Usage is subject to per-plan limits, and activity can be tracked through the Compliance API.\n\nSources:\n- [Introducing Codex — OpenAI](https://openai.com/index/introducing-codex/)\n- [Introducing upgrades to Codex — OpenAI](https://openai.com/index/introducing-upgrades-to-codex/)\n- [Using Codex with your ChatGPT plan — OpenAI Help Center](https://help.openai.com/en/articles/11369540-using-codex-with-your-chatgpt-plan)",
